<title>UK: BA says pound strength hitting yields.</title>
<headline>BA says pound strength hitting yields.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways chairman Sir Colin Marshall said on Tuesday the strength of sterling had hit average fare yields in the current year.</p>
<p>&quot;Results for the first quarter of the current financial year (to the end of June) are not due to be announced until mid-August,&quot; Marshall told the annual meeting of shareholders.</p>
<p>&quot;I can tell you, however, that while bookings maintain their buoyant trend, the strength of sterling has affected yields.&quot;</p>
<p>Marshall gave no further details.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
